================================================================================
Scientific Provenance & Theoretical Foundations
================================================================================

This software implements and operationalizes the mathematical theorems, information
ledgers, and semantic gating models established in:

    "Latitude and Doubt: Exact Information Accounting and Lossless Decomposition"
    by M. M. Atta (2026).

